<title>USA: New Mexico and Arizona Land Co sets dividend.</title>
<headline>New Mexico and Arizona Land Co sets dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Mexico and Arizona Land Co said Friday its board of directors declared a 10 percent common stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on July 18, record June 16.</p>
<p>Fractional shares will be paid in cash.</p>
</text>
